# Instant edge redirects to whichever project is currently first
# (lowest `order` value in src/content/works/*.md — currently sediment).
# If you reorder projects so a different one is first, update the
# target here too. The matching src/pages/*.astro files redirect the
# same way automatically as a fallback (a client-side meta-refresh),
# just without the instant edge hop — that fallback has a visible
# 2-second delay, so this file is what actually makes it instant.
/ /works/sediment/ 302
/works /works/sediment/ 302
/works/ /works/sediment/ 302
